{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act38side_level_act38side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act38side",
  "stageId": "act38side_07",
  "title": "揭幕时刻",
  "storyCode": "PV-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "72c9f1009199e27196ae4dfacbc7ed0c764e8de98963df0be97322e569fc8f6d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "啧啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "我们来迟了，这两帮人已经打完了，没一个活口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "拉普兰德，你停下与我的决斗，只是为了来看这个无聊的火并现场？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一人一狼站在清晨的荒野上，不远处停着一辆黄色的出租车。\n出租车的车头与一块巨石亲密接触，引擎盖已经深深地凹陷下去。车身后扭曲的车辙与翻飞的土石诉说着它刚刚是怎样一路狂飙而来......\n车的周围横七竖八地躺着好几具尸体。风把血腥味送远，野兽的低吟声若隐若现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "扎罗，有两件事你得搞清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "第一，我不是给你解闷的玩物；第二，作为给我解闷的玩物，几个月下来，我发现不死不灭的狼之主也没趣得很......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "相比之下，一场莫名其妙发生在这荒野上的家族火并，不是更有看头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "哈哈，车撞成这样，居然还能发动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "它的目的地本来是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "让我看看......地图上被圈出来的地点是——“新沃尔西尼”，储物盒里还有入关文件......还挺齐全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "熟悉的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "喂，扎罗，帮忙把这些尸体拖到一边，腾出倒车的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "你要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "这可是叙拉古给你我的邀请函。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "难道你要拒绝邀请？狼之主这么没礼貌吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "我说过，在我们的斗争结束之前，我会与你同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "那就过来帮忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>1100年10月25日    9:00 P.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃，您、您不用向我鞠躬的，卡彭先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别紧张，我只是不想自己这凶神恶煞的模样把你吓走，毕竟你好不容易才答应这次的见面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您的提议我想了很久。如果被市政厅的人发现我私下转让市民积分，会不会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你只不过需要在那一大堆资质文件里挑几份，然后写份说明，更正一下所属人，很简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这样我能得到五十个积分，你能得到......很大一笔钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们又没违规犯法，如果市政厅的人真有异议，那只不过说明《新都市管理法案》本身的规定还不够完善，这个你应该比我懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "话是这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "身份登记本身就很不公平，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我明明已经洗心革面，因为有前科，这半年交了那么多认证金，做了那么多社区服务，一百二十个市民积分连一半都没攒到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但像你，“履历清白”“从事法律等特定技术行业”......你才刚来新沃尔西尼，换算的市民积分都够成为三次新沃尔西尼市民了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不转让给我，也是白白浪费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......那、那好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我申请的正式认证时间在下周，在那之前我把你要的资质文件更正过来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别那么急，朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，急的不是你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，我的意思是，你有没有考虑过，别那么着急成为新沃尔西尼市民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什、什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在新沃尔西尼，像我这样缺积分的人很多，但像你这样能攒积分的人少之又少，你迟一点正式认证，就可以一直靠转让......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我很乐意当个中间人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "新沃尔西尼推行《新都市管理法案》，就是为了防止你们这些人——抱、抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "总之，如果这样做，不就和这座城市的建立初衷背道而驰了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，朋友，放轻松放轻松，我只是随口说说，你别介意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想一想，你来这座城市是为了什么......更稳定的收入？更好的新生活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这真的是你成为新沃尔西尼合法市民，找一个律所打杂能带来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "（鼓掌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "拉普兰德，你还要看多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "急什么，不吃饱怎么开夜车？新鲜的玉米糕，来一块？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "算了，不浪费了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "你的心情不错......就因为看了这么一场莫名其妙的交易？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "扎罗，我们来到新沃尔西尼多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "两个多月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "两个多月，我们去了多少地方，载了多少客人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你不觉得这座城市所有人都一本正经得让你浑身难受吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "市政厅的职员和法院的法官恨不得把他们的法案贴在脑门上，时时刻刻绷紧神经，和叙拉古的一切旧习惯旧规则作斗争......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "而家族的人则想尽办法证明自己有多么喜欢多么适应这套新的游戏规则。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "我从来没见过叙拉古人这么拘束，这么坐立难安，像是在脸上焊了一张面具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "马上可就是狂欢节了，他们真的有心情享受所谓的狂欢吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "感谢这两位为市民积分发愁的朋友，告诉我叙拉古还是那个叙拉古，而把一切新地盘变成泥潭，是叙拉古人的本能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "哈哈，这样看起来，接下来的狂欢节，还是值得期待的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "喂，你有没有在听？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "我闻到了他们的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你是说你的同胞，其他的狼之主？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "不打算去叙叙旧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "已经退出的狼之主，不应再干涉游戏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "别摆出那副死样，扎罗。你是输了，但不代表你不能继续从中找到乐趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "想想自己还能做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "别那么拘束，我们回来可是要在这座泥潭畅游的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "那你呢，你什么时候去和自己的过去打个招呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你是说我那亲爱的父亲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "我已经和他道过别了......虽然这次狂欢节我还是给他准备了礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "出租车司机不再说话，她将腿搭在了方向盘上，换了个更舒服的姿势。\n透过车窗，能看见出租车前面的墙壁上贴着一家酒庄的巨幅广告，眉峰紧锁的男人向着镜头伸出酒杯，发出邀请——\n“萨卢佐酒业，开放资深法务等多个岗位，诚邀你的加盟！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族法务",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1554_1",
      "text": "......老爷，资料都在这里了，请您过目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族法务",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1554_1",
      "text": "我们在本城的酒庄共计十三家，其中有六家正在接受资质审核，暂时无法投入运营。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族法务",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1554_1",
      "text": "外围地块上的两个葡萄园即将迎来首次采收，仓库、实验室和灌装作业线也都已经建好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族法务",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1554_1",
      "text": "只有半数酒庄的话，短时间内根本无法处理这么多成熟的葡萄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族法务",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1554_1",
      "text": "根本问题还是出在市政厅的态度上，那些家伙明显在针对我们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "资料是为对面的朋友准备的，他有能力解决这些问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿尔贝托看向品酒桌的另一侧，红发的鲁珀已经在位置上坐了有一会儿了。\n酒终于醒好，他抿了一口，平静地对上阿尔贝托的目光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "将萨卢佐家在新沃尔西尼的所有产业——正常运行的，尚未得到承认的——进行整合重组，注册成新的实体......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然后聘请非利益相关人员负责实际的经营管理，这在《新都市管理法案》下确实是可行的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "可以简单理解为，我会将这些产业过户给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "贝洛内家的生意规模不大，涉及到的审批流程也并不复杂，你却吃了十来回闭门羹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "当事情扯上“贝洛内”或者“萨卢佐”，市政厅和法院，应该说莱昂图索和拉维妮娅，反应一向比较过激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "听起来我没有理由拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "德米特里，我更看重的是，没有人比你更懂莱昂图索在想什么，也没有人比你更懂如何运用他所制定的规则——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "你是最适合这个位置的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "我倒想看看，遵照《新都市管理法案》，合法合规地将两个家族再次绑在一起，市政厅还会不会这么明目张胆地对你我施压。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "你说对吧？贝洛内家的新家主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别把我当作傀儡，阿尔贝托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我承认，贝洛内企业的申请并不顺利，你的邀请很及时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你能甩掉一些麻烦，而我获得了进入新沃尔西尼的资格。你我只是商业合作，各取所需罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪怕贝洛内家族在叙拉古已经不复往昔，哪怕这座新城市里不存在家族，你仍需清楚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我选择在萨卢佐酒业任职，绝不代表贝洛内家族对萨卢佐家族的服从。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以你最好改掉称呼，我不是以贝洛内家新家主的身份坐在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "逞强没有意义，年轻人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "你我的这种合作是否意味着“贝洛内投向了萨卢佐”——我倒是好奇莱昂图索会如何理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "哦我都忘了，他或许已经完全不在意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "他已经弃你而去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "非要聊到这个话题......阿尔贝托，你难道不是孤家寡人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "萨卢佐家的白狼，你的女儿，一再违背你的命令，已经永远地脱离了家族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而据我所知，她早在几个月前就已经来到了新沃尔西尼......当一个出租车司机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也很好奇，她有没有特地来落井下石，或者重回家族，为如今的萨卢佐出一份力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "......拉普兰德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "是我驱逐了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "以我对她的了解，恐怕她自己不是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "德米特里，我不会将这视作你的冒犯，你和贝纳尔多不一样，你看得懂局势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔贝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "text": "这些无伤大雅的分歧不会伤害到我们共同的利益，那何尝不能把这看作合作的良好开端呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那好，我也不废话了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "先在这份股权文件上签字吧，阿尔贝托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当月的分红就当作我邀请莱昂叙旧的活动经费了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>1100年11月5日    10:45 P.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你去找过你的同胞了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "嗯，一头虚伪又狡诈的狼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "恺撒已经把她的獠牙变成了一个只知道撕咬和吮血的傻子，就算把鼻子闻烂，她也不可能找得到瓦古的獠牙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "那个家伙始终未曾露面，他把自己藏得很深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "但依靠贝纳尔多的影响力，在叙拉古社会里找到一个叙拉古人，就像风翻出藏在荒草堆里的小动物一样简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "我不帮他们，这一轮游戏不知道又要拖到几时才能结束！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "扎罗，你这个滔滔不绝的样子真是难得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你在搅局，你很乐在其中嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "彼此彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "这就对了，别那么计较输赢。学会享受它，从中挖掘出更多的乐趣，这才是游戏的真谛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你们这几头狼，怎么连这点道理都没想明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "新沃尔西尼的夜色正浓。\n一人一狼站在建筑的高处，他们的头顶是寂静的夜空，身下是喧闹的城市——\n狂欢节前各种光怪陆离的预热活动，高速驶过的车辆，来来往往的行人，大街小巷里发生的一切都尽收眼底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "这些人用面具遮挡自己的獠牙，用狂欢宣泄骨子里的征服欲，何其可悲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "反倒是你，拉普兰德，你站在这高处一脸享受。什么时候你也对这种无聊的活动感兴趣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你好吵啊，扎罗，以前待在我身边的人可比你安静多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "我只是在吹风。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "这个位置可是贵宾席，安静等戏开场就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "演员们都已经站上舞台了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你迟到了，莱昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉，今天实在有点忙不过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还在忙你的就职演说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那只是一小部分......毕竟现在是要为整座城市办一个庆生派对，我们之前都只有在家里办派对的经验，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没想到你还会记得......那时候的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么会不记得？你是指望我忘记你用姜汁汽水代替家宴上的黑啤酒，然后用差价去买车的故事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈——是有这么回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "德米特......你听上去怎么有些......心不在焉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没什么，可能是太久没见面了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "路上小心，莱昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱昂图索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，如果不是在新沃尔西尼，这句话听上去会更像威胁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别开玩笑了。快点过来吧，我在靠窗的位置等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "轿车路过了街道边上小跑的裁缝店学徒，驶向了大道的尽头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢奇诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "text": "得再快点了，一定不能错过把衣服交给阿尔贝托先生的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢奇诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "text": "......萨卢佐家族的首领......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢奇诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "text": "阿尔贝托先生会是什么样的一个人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卢奇诺气喘吁吁地抱着礼服跑过一条无人问津的小巷，小巷中唯有一处私人咖啡馆的灯依旧亮着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你已经往肚子里塞了三杯果汁五块披萨了......有那么饿吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "闭上你的嘴，喝完这杯浓缩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呕......太酸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是我喝了拉肚子，耽误了任务，你把头借给我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "忍忍吧，我随便买的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是条辅路，本来也没什么人。再说，只是运送一批“轮胎”，能出什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "说是在路上接应，其实就是个闲差，本来也没什么功劳好捞，那么上心做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这两个月我已经听够你的抱怨了，甘比诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你还没有摸清楚新老板的性格吗？太急切地在他面前表现自己，只会适得其反。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们才刚入伙没多久，需要等待机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你还真是一个懂老板的好员工啊，卡彭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我还以为你在说起这些事情时，多少会有些耻辱感，“西西里人”在如今的叙拉古已经寸步难行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦不，我早就不是“西西里人”了。那是你的耻辱，又不是我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只想早点拿到正式落户新沃尔西尼的资格。这半年我花了多少功夫，交了多少认证金，才刚好攒够一半的市民积分——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "刚好一半？你怎么比我多五十分？你偷偷去做社区服务了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "闭嘴吧。我们已经没有再来一次的机会了，甘比诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盯紧前面这条街吧，车应该马上就要来了——\n还有披萨吗？给我来一块。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "妈的，凉的你都吃得下去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在两人互相埋怨的时候，一道黑影悄无声息地窜过了小巷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红",
      "speakerId": "char_144_red",
      "text": "（嗅嗅）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红",
      "speakerId": "char_144_red",
      "text": "这个味道没有错，是真狼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一辆卡车驶过红的面前，引起了她的注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红",
      "speakerId": "char_144_red",
      "text": "你躲在里面吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红",
      "speakerId": "char_144_red",
      "text": "（嗅嗅）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红",
      "speakerId": "char_144_red",
      "text": "不在。嗯，在街道的那边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她望向了街道的另一头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红",
      "speakerId": "char_144_red",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红",
      "speakerId": "char_144_red",
      "text": "外婆，红是猎狼人，红记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "text": "是她们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "text": "瓦古，希望你留下的辨别手段没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "text": "唉......真要误伤了反倒头疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "提刀的沃尔珀靠在墙边的阴影中，静静等待着最好的时机。\n她将一举清除两个可能威胁到翁贝托安全的目标，然后向那头狼讨要回报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "啧，这么晚了还有孩子在大街上乱晃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1502_crosly_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1502_crosly_1",
      "text": "（那个人......是看错了吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "柳德米拉，柳德米拉......你怎么突然发呆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1502_crosly_1",
      "text": "没什么......有点累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "待会儿到前面的路口，你下去等我吧。快到地方了，让威尼斯的人看到我带了不相干的人，会有麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1502_crosly_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "柳德米拉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1502_crosly_1",
      "text": "行了，别说那么多了。我已经上了车，今晚这一趟我会陪你走完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "谢谢你，柳德米拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "不管怎么样，幸好有你陪我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "哼哼♪哼哼哼♪哼~~♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1502_crosly_1",
      "text": "索默尔，从刚刚开始，这首歌你都循环了好几遍了，还没腻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "当然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "《不期而会》，多好听的歌，Sora小姐的歌声多么美妙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索默尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1547_1",
      "text": "这可是这周最热的单曲，听采访说这是Sora小姐特意为这次狂欢节录制的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "索默尔跟着车载音箱循环的歌曲哼唱着。\n马上，这辆卡车将会行驶到前方的转折点，在那里它会与另一辆轿车亲密接触。\n狂欢节的序幕正缓缓拉开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "小小的一个街区，年轻有为的代理市长、獠牙、归乡的人，还有如今不知道又投靠了谁的西西里人......多热闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "我可以让它更热闹一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "好好待着，什么都不需要做，扎罗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "就像一个准时打开收音机的出租车司机那样，等着听故事就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "人类的游戏，可比你们刻意挑选几个人在那打来打去有意思得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "恺撒的狼崽子已经发现了阿涅塞的狼崽子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "快看，港口那边是不是开过来了另外一辆车？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "——“砰！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡车与轿车相撞后仓皇逃离。刺目的火光，惊惶的人群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "既然身处同一个舞台，上演的当然是同一出好戏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扎罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_688_1",
      "text": "一场混乱而已，我没看到什么乐趣，拉普兰德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "你为什么这么急呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "在真正开始看戏之前，先让我尽到一位好市民的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "喂，您好，是警察先生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "我？我是一个出租车司机，我要报警。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普兰德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1564_1",
      "text": "......嗯嗯，港口区，没错，这里刚刚发生了一起车祸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
